  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï Yeso kinetankachi, “Pkonchini pich tïkwïn cho ighöy chane kwigh ngokï nyo mötïny. Wölo ochech chichona weru tïkuchoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mïchini chi nyo lenyoni kerötyï kat koghpa pagh nyo wow akewirchï nanam kwen, kïtïl kwigh akonga ompö cho mïnkech kwigh ngokï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 18:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Orip kegh le! Ato lelunyi werïngwo isyölchï, akwato kötö ilöstoghchï nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato lelunyi nyinte kïnyïl mut nko odeny ompö asisini akonga akïmïla wölo imitenyi kïnyïl mut nko odeny akïlö, ‘Kokötan,’ kïmïchini löstoghchinönyi nyinte.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kighanat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï asistanka kiyoktoghï Echotyon, “Töswecha kighanat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Echotyon chane, “Ntökotïngetekwa kighanat nyo mïnïng nyo tenö kösïghyonto ket nyo kïkuro aradali, omukekwa omwochï ketï lö, ‘Ngeta nko ighinköku lö ikötkötyï kegh nanam,’ kïterwokwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ighisyo mötworin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitas tagh Yeso, kunetisyö lö, “Ato itïngönyi mötworin nyo ngoröy par anta nyo yokuyöy kyak, akwotini körotï kaw, melö ilenchinenyi töpenö ngwïny lawel aiyomisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ilenchinenyi, ‘Ighe omisyenyan aipkanïn aiköngisyö ntomisyan agheghsyö. Atomuchö iomisyö aigheghsyö nyinte.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayo, kiyokyini mötworin sörö lö, ompöwölo kegh kïgh nyo kikïmwochï kwigh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyoni ompö akwa tïkwïl, akanya otini kaghakwa tïkwïn löwïr cho kökïlenchokwa agha, amwagh lö, ‘Kïchicha mötworköku cho mökïmöro kïgh kikusat. Kakighacha pat tïkuchini kökïmwowecha kegha kïpoto.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kesop Yeso pich taman",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kimi Yeso pantanyi kutöngöy Yerusalem, kuwerata rotyo Samaria nko Kalilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kilït kanasyan akonga ompö wöloni, kïtuyeghö pich taman cho kyamate psenkwet. Kighyongö chane wölo low kite, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atolapay kuteghyö kïlentöy, “Yeso, Echotyon, syonchecha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 14:1-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otini kisïwa Yeso chane, kïlenchï, “Ape ye oporchinö kegh tïsï.” Otini kimi pan, kïweghö chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget akong ompö chane nyo otini kisïwa lö kyosöp, kïmïla kïsölonu Tororöt ompö kut nyo wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kupïtyï kelyo Yeso akuyokyï sörö. Ki chi pö Samaria nyinte, pïchay sösöy pipö Yaudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atoni nyu kïlö Yeso, “Ayo nki pich taman cho kökisop, pich taman, kunko chay le mut nko angwan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kölö ne tökïlïkwï chichï le ton onkït nyo kamïla kuyokyï Tororöt sörö?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï Yeso chichay, “Ngeta aiwechï kegh, kesopinyi kighanatengu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kingwïnata Pöyunöto Tororöt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep Parisaytin* walaka Yeso lö, “Ekwoyï ato itu Pöyunöto Tororöt?” Kïlenchï, “Molenchï kegh itu Pöyunöto Tororöt ompö or nyo kesïwïyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möminye chi nyo muköy kimwa lö, ‘Arosa anyï,’ anta, ‘Onyinö,’ ompöwölo mi Pöyunöto Tororöt kwenunkwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï kinetankachi, “Itu osiswö cho opïrchinekwa lö, tökïsïwa asis nyo le ompö akonga nyo pö Wero Chi, wölo mosïwïyekwanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pkonöy pich cho lenchinokwa, ‘Arosa, anyinö,’ anta, ‘Arosa anyï mi yi,’ wölo mapa lö sarpap, amarïp chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kïle wölo wöchtoy kiryol kuwongwongö ompö yïm, kïlïku nyoni Wero Chi ompö asistanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo nyo pö tagh kuwongu nyinte nyoman akïtagh pïnete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
